---
import PolicyLayout from "../../components/PolicyLayout.astro"
import { SITE } from "../../lib/site"
---
<PolicyLayout title="Cancellation policy" description="How to cancel a Toonhub order.">
  <p>You may request cancellation within 24 hours of placing an order, provided the order has not yet entered production or been handed to the carrier.</p>
  <h2>How to cancel</h2>
  <p>Email {SITE.email} with your order number and the subject “Cancel order”. We'll confirm by email.</p>
  <h2>After shipping</h2>
  <p>Once an order has shipped it cannot be cancelled. You may refuse the delivery or follow our <a href="/policies/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a> after it arrives.</p>
  <h2>Custom items</h2>
  <p>Made-to-order or personalized figures cannot be cancelled once production has started.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
